  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "You are given 333 sticks of length AAA, BBB and CCC.\n\nPlease check if they can be the side lengths of a valid non-degenerate triangle.\n\nRecall that A,BA, BA,B and CCC can be the side-lengths of a non-degenerate triangle if and only if each of the following 333 conditions hold:\n\n\nA+B&gt;CA + B &gt; CA+B&gt;C\nB+C&gt;AB + C &gt; AB+C&gt;A\nA+C&gt;BA + C &gt; BA+C&gt;B\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first and only line of input contains 333 integers - A,BA, BA,B and CCC.\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, output on a new line Yes\\text{Yes}Yes if the side lengths form a valid triangle, and else No\\text{No}No.\n\n\nIt is allowed to print each character in either case. For example, YES\\text{YES}YES, yes\\text{yes}yes and yEs\\text{yEs}yEs will all be accepted as positive responses.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤A,B,C≤101 \\le A, B, C \\le 101≤A,B,C≤10"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
    "sampleTestCases": [
      {
        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "2 3 4",
        "output": "Yes",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nAll the conditions are satisfied and so it is a valid triangle."
      },
      {
        "id": "sample_2",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "4 6 2",
        "output": "No",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nThe condition A+C>BA + C > BA+C>B is not true here, hence it is not valid."
      },
      {
        "id": "sample_3",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "9 9 9",
        "output": "Yes",
        "explanation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
